    {
      "paperId": "28e28b98349b4b686426f186acf6b7c6d5028ed8",
      "title": "Enhancing Road Safety Through Deep Learning-Based Traffic Sign Recognition and Classification for Autonomous Vehicles",
      "abstract": "The paper strategies an intelligent vision-based system to progress road safety by leveraging the capability of autonomous vehicles to recognize and understand traffic signs suitably in real time. The greater part the existing methods of traffic signs recognition that do not have the performance under difficult vision conditions, for example, in low lighting, inclement weather and partial occlusion of signs, which in turn may reduce visibility thereby affecting driving decisions. The proposed work integrates the real-time capability of YOLOv8 with an attentionbased classifier using EfficientNet-B3 for accurate sign recognition. Transfer learning techniques help improve the generalization capability of the trained model under various environmental conditions. To ensure healthier explainability, Explainable AI techniques such as Grad-CAM are used to emphasize the areas of the input image attributes which impact model predictions. The system is optimized to fit an edge platform to facilitate rapid inference and progressive learning. The effectiveness of the proposed framework is verified on benchmark datasets to demonstrate high accuracy, adaptability, and interpretability, making it a trusted solution for autonomous driving and intelligent transportation systems.",
